n talking about for  generations once quirks become too  strong or once there are too many quirks  within one body the body can no longer  handle all of that power and the user  loses control of the quirks and of his  own body human bodies simply do not  evolve as quickly as quirks do and this  is something that ujico had tried to  warn the world about but no one listened  now although jiko's warnings were  ignored by much of the world he  continued to research the problem of  quirk singularity with the support of  all for one and his solution to this  problem was the very procedure that he  performed on shigaraki he basically  insulated shigaraki from the problem of  quirk singularity by drastically  modifying his body which now allows  shigaraki to accommodate more quirks and  more power than any normal human body  the explosive growth that his new  mutated body is undergoing is a side  effect of this procedure in the latest  chapter we return to the big ua fight  with an absolutely wild and shigeraki  just straight up surfing on his finger  mutations as they come closer and closer  to filling up the entire ua enclosure  there doesn't appear to be a limit to  how much of this mutation shigaraki can  generate and so the entire battlefield  is now a huge grotesque mass of mutated  hands and fingers the heroes and hero  students who are there are doing their  best to beat back the progress of  shigaraki's mutations but they just  can't destroy them quickly enough they  grow faster than they are being  destroyed we see sun eater negede genist  miruko bakugo and headshot all  struggling against the mountains of  fingers that are rushing right at them  and it becomes clear very quickly that  trying to destroy all these fingers is  not a sustainable strategy they need to  get past the fingers and attack  shigaraki's main body and they need to  do it quickly thankfully the finger  mutations are not as strong as  shigaraki's main body so they can be  destroyed but again they just keep  growing and growing endlessly seeing  that he has the advantage shigaraki uses  this moment to go full light yagami he  says that with his new body and power he  will create a new world and he will be  the god of this new world currently the  world is divided and full of conflict  but once he takes power and rules over  everyone the gaps between people that  give rise to misunderstandings fear and  rejection will disappear because  everyone will then be equal in  oppression everyone will be equally at  the mercy of the one true ruler of the  world which is a type of equality i  guess bakugou says that he doesn't know  whether this is shigaraki talking or all  for one but he proclaims that he doesn't  want to hear one more word from either  of them although the current  relationship between offer one and  chikaraki inside of this one body seems  to be complex i believe that this is  primarily all for one talking at this  point shikaraki never gave off these  light yagami vibes at least not to me so  i believe that this is mostly all for  one at least for the time being i fully  expect that the real shigeraki will take  back control of his body eventually  bakugou then initiates his ultimate  support item area suppressing heavy  armor called panzer although quick note  we will have to wait for the viz  translation for the official english  name this armor makes bakugo look like a  human tank or a human mecha as a bunch  of high-tech and high-powered blasters  appear on his back and shoulders and  then he begins to fire explosive blasts  all around him destroying shigaraki's  mutations in a blazing inferno the other  heroes rushed to take advantage of  bakugou's attack and as miroko points  out bakugo is finally learning the art  of teamwork everyone is doing their part  and there is no room for individual egos  in this fight because without working  together everyone is absolutely screwed  that's why we have nato and izawa  erasing shigaraki's quirk kami