dy and to  kill off popular characters so we could  definitely see some of the heroes or  hero students at ua dying before deku  arrives such a tragedy would emphasize  just how consequential this final battle  is and it would definitely spur deku to  give it his all in the final showdown we  could be heading for a very bloody and  tragic ending of mha where the good guys  win in the end because it's a shonen but  they still make many sacrifices along  the way personally i don't see a major  character like say bakugo dying in the  final war but i could totally see the  mentor characters like all might  endeavor or izawa dying or some of the  less important students like the class  1b gang or someone like kaminadi daku  being deku even a single death because  he allowed himself to be sent to the  wrong location would absolutely break  his heart and his rage and regret would  turn him into a completely different  character at least temporarily such a  tragedy would have a massive impact on  deku's personality during the final  battle and it might even allow him to  unlock his final quirk or maybe even a  new form it's possible that when deck  unlocks his final quirk his body will  begin to change as a result of the quirk  singularity problem i talked about this  before in previous videos but this could  lead to deku going berserk and attaining  a completely new form just in time for  the final battle with shigaraki i am  leaning towards a major side character  dying in the near future and this loss  then triggering deku to awaken a new  form or power let me know if you guys  agree with this will a major character  die and will this change deku and maybe  give him a new power up will the ending  of mha end up being tragic and bloody or  do you believe that we will see a more  wholesome ending when the show first  started i was definitely expecting a  wholesome ending but in these last few  arcs things have gotten a lot darker  than they were before finally what did  yo